{
  "abstract": "\u039bp interactions have been studied at momenta up to 24 GeV/ c using a new bubble chamber technique. We find that the \u039bp elastic cross section has fallen to approximately 6 mb at the highest momentum. Results are presented on \u039b p\u2192 \u039b p \u03c0 + \u03c0 \u2212 for the first time above 5 GeV c .",
